1
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,520
How's the University of Political Science and Law?

2
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:01,119
What year are you in?

3
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,359
Senior year.

4
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,200
Senior year.

5
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,640
Graduating soon, aren't you?

6
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,079
Your mother once

7
00:01:08,719 --> 00:01:10,000
asked me a question on your behalf.

8
00:01:10,359 --> 00:01:12,760
She said she saw it in your notebook.

9
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,719
You know about it, right?

10
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:14,879
I really want to know...

11
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,840
By now,

12
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,319
that answer...

13
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:20,599
have you found it?

14
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,159
I think I have.

15
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,359
Is that so?

16
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:27,879
Good.

17
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,599
As long as you found it.

18
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:31,799
Study hard.

19
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:32,840
Don't worry.

20
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:37,920
All rise.

21
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:42,680
Defendant Yang Dongmei,

22
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:45,000
for the crime of intentional homicide,

23
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:47,159
considering it constituted excessive self-defense,

24
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,959
having long suffered domestic violence,

25
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:53,359
with no further societal harm caused after the incident,

26
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:55,560
villagers jointly providing a bail guarantee,

27
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,120
and bearing a good reputation,

28
00:01:57,599 --> 00:02:00,280
is sentenced to six years' imprisonment.

29
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:21,080
I looked through countless cases in school,

30
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:24,000
but I could never find the real answer.

31
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:28,400
Yet the answer is often right beside us.

32
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,479
I once believed

33
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:33,360
in the theory that criminals are inherently guilty,

34
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,840
and I saw people like Shi Qing,

35
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,120
utterly devoid of humanity.

36
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,080
I could never imagine

37
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:43,120
that

38
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:45,319
someone like you, Mom,

39
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,400
a victim of abuse,

40
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,680
could be the one who actually committed the crime.

41
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,080
I believe

42
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:53,639
human nature is fundamentally good.

43
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:55,919
Every change in a person

44
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:57,280
hinges on internal causes.

45
00:02:58,199 --> 00:02:59,280
Internal causes are decisive.

46
00:02:59,439 --> 00:03:01,280
They are the basis

47
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,240
for how every case happens and develops.

48
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,639
While the surrounding environment

49
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:11,159
acts as the external cause,

50
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,360
the external condition for development.

51
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,719
Its impact on the situation

52
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,879
serves to

53
00:03:18,919 --> 00:03:21,439
accelerate or delay the process.

54
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,800
In many cases,

55
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,599
external causes

56
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,479
lead to the ultimate evil outcome.

57
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,120
Dad.

58
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,480
Here.

59
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,680
Xiaohua, have some water. Sit up slowly.

60
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:49,879
Slowly now.

61
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:51,879
Here.

62
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,360
Have another sip.

63
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,120
Xiaohua.

64
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,319
You must be hungry.

65
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,000
Here.

66
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:50,399
Have some porridge.

67
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,680
Careful.

68
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:00,959
Good.

69
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:03,680
Here.

70
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,920
Come on, one more bite.

71
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:16,120
Mom, Dad!

72
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,000
Look, I got Model Student!

73
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,240
The whole class clapped!

74
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:21,879
Look!

75
00:08:27,199 --> 00:08:27,800
That's wonderful!

76
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,360
Mom, don't cry.

77
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,920
I'll win more awards.

78
00:08:31,959 --> 00:08:32,960
Lots of them!

79
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:34,960
That's a promise, then.

80
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:37,159
Pinky swear with Mom, okay?

81
00:08:37,519 --> 00:08:38,080
Come here.

82
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:43,519
Pinky promise, a hundred years,

83
00:08:43,519 --> 00:08:44,600
never break it.

84
00:08:45,039 --> 00:08:45,440
Seal it!

85
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,440
It's a promise.

86
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,960
Alright, go on.

87
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,480
Dad will get you some porridge soon.

88
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,279
Go do your homework.

89
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,639
If it's cold, light the stove.

90
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,600
Come on, Xiaohua. Here.

91
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,960
Take your medicine.

92
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,600
Careful.

93
00:09:14,559 --> 00:09:15,200
It's hot.

94
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,159
A bit hot.

95
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,000
Alright.

96
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:27,799
I know.

97
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,720
For your illness, you should see a doctor in the city.

98
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,320
We're not that lucky.

99
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,080
We don't have the money either.

100
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:37,399
I'm sorry.

101
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,720
It's all my fault.

102
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,120
It's all my fault.

103
00:09:45,879 --> 00:09:47,639
You gave us such a wonderful son,

104
00:09:49,039 --> 00:09:51,360
and got stuck with a useless husband like me.

105
00:09:55,039 --> 00:09:55,679
I'm so sorry.

106
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:21,399
Lately, I keep dreaming about your mom.

107
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:26,519
In the dream, she's sitting on the kang, doing fine.

108
00:10:28,519 --> 00:10:29,519
She starts crying,

109
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:33,600
saying life has been too hard,

110
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:36,000
that she can't take it anymore.

111
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,039
But when she talks about you,

112
00:10:39,039 --> 00:10:40,159
she smiles again.

113
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:44,200
She says, "Our Tongtong has grown so big,

114
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,159
so smart and kind."

115
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,039
Her mind is at ease now.

116
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,720
So she told me,

117
00:10:58,759 --> 00:10:59,639
"Please...

118
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:01,960
I beg you...

119
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,360
Just let me go."

120
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,879
Dad, I'm full.

121
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,320
I'll go do my homework.

122
00:11:10,639 --> 00:11:11,759
No homework tonight.

123
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,080
Just go to sleep.

124
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:23,639
Comrade Zhang Aihua was family to our factory,

125
00:13:24,399 --> 00:13:27,360
and the devoted wife of one of our honest workers.

126
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,080
During these six years of illness,

127
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,399
Liu spared no effort

128
00:13:30,399 --> 00:13:31,799
caring for her at home,

129
00:13:32,279 --> 00:13:34,000
without ever taking extended leave.

130
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:34,759
Liu,

131
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,600
I know how hard it's been on your family.

132
00:13:38,279 --> 00:13:39,360
Her passing

133
00:13:40,039 --> 00:13:41,159
is also a relief.

134
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,440
Don't blame yourself too much.

135
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:45,759
We workers stand by our conscience.

136
00:13:46,559 --> 00:13:48,440
You never neglected your shifts at the factory,

137
00:13:48,799 --> 00:13:51,399
and the factory won't forget what you've done.

138
00:13:52,799 --> 00:13:53,399
Xiao Ye.

139
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:56,919
Uncle Liu,

140
00:13:57,799 --> 00:13:59,360
get some good rest these next few days.

141
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,600
Put factory work aside for now.

142
00:14:02,399 --> 00:14:03,519
Your son is still young,

143
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:05,039
so just let us know if you need anything.

144
00:14:05,039 --> 00:14:06,159
Don't bear it all alone.

145
00:14:07,519 --> 00:14:09,080
The factory knows your situation.

146
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:11,159
The director applied for some funds for you.

147
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,279
It's not much,

148
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,639
but it's a token of our support.

149
00:14:13,639 --> 00:14:14,440
Take it, please take it.

150
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,600
Thank you, Director.

151
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:18,559
Thank you, everyone.

152
00:14:18,559 --> 00:14:20,320
All right, please sign right here.

153
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:26,679
My daughter!

154
00:14:26,679 --> 00:14:28,559
Mom, please get up.

155
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,840
Mom!

156
00:14:30,159 --> 00:14:31,240
Oh, my sweet daughter!

157
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:35,799
How could you leave like this?

158
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,879
My poor daughter!

159
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,759
Tell me...

160
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:42,320
Child,

161
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,279
tell Grandma right now.

162
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,240
How did your mother pass away?

163
00:14:47,039 --> 00:14:47,840
Dad said

164
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,639
Mom came in a dream visitation,

165
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,639
saying it was too painful.

166
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,879
She said, "Let me go."

167
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,200
And then...

168
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:59,600
I saw Dad use a pillow...

169
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,360
You monster!

170
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,200
Dad did nothing wrong!

171
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:07,799
Dad did nothing wrong!

172
00:15:09,559 --> 00:15:10,559
Dad did nothing wrong!

173
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:13,480
Mom really came in a dream visitation!

174
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,519
Dad did nothing wrong!

175
00:15:15,879 --> 00:15:17,240
Mom really came in a dream visitation!

176
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:20,200
She said she wanted to go!

177
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,440
How could you be so cruel?

178
00:15:25,279 --> 00:15:26,519
She was still breathing!

179
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,679
You scum!

180
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:30,840
Liu Wendou.

181
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:35,679
Something happened at your wife's memorial yesterday.

182
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:37,879
It was reported

183
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:41,600
that your son said some things there.

184
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:44,399
Pretty serious, isn't it?

185
00:15:48,559 --> 00:15:49,000
Come on.

186
00:15:50,639 --> 00:15:51,600
Tell us yourself.

187
00:15:52,879 --> 00:15:53,559
Confess the truth.

188
00:15:54,559 --> 00:15:55,440
It's been six years.

189
00:15:58,639 --> 00:15:59,919
Aihua suffered too much.

190
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,039
The doctor said

191
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,799
even the marrow in her bones was rotting.

192
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:11,039
She came to me in a dream visitation.

193
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:12,919
She said,

194
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,360
"Send me on my way."

195
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:18,639
Dream visitation?

196
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:23,360
Pushing feudal superstition on me, are you?

197
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,679
I know.

198
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:32,279
I shouldn't have done it.

199
00:16:34,519 --> 00:16:35,879
But at that moment,

200
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,480
I was putting her out of her misery.

201
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,919
Putting her out of her misery, my ass!

202
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:44,799
That's murder!

203
00:16:46,159 --> 00:16:47,879
Aihua was with me for 20 years,

204
00:16:53,519 --> 00:16:55,159
and I never did anything for her.

205
00:16:58,399 --> 00:16:59,679
This

206
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,759
was the only thing I could do

207
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:04,039
to bring her relief.

208
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:05,519
Everything you've said

209
00:17:05,519 --> 00:17:07,240
has been truthfully recorded in the file.

210
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:08,880
But you must realize,

211
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:10,319
what you did

212
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,599
isn't as simple as a dream visitation

213
00:17:11,759 --> 00:17:13,039
and putting her out of her misery.

214
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,160
This is murder.

215
00:17:15,519 --> 00:17:16,680
This was an act against

216
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,880
a defenseless human life,

217
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,160
an outright murder.

218
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:20,799
It's a crime.
